(888, 7, 'reading', 'What does Ms. Nga ask to do?', '["Visit next Monday for a tour", "Start work tomorrow", "Meet the director today", "Call her tonight"]', 0, 'Xin ghe tham quan vao thu 2. EN: "May I visit next Monday for a tour?" is asked.', 'comprehension', 'hr', 824, 'Job Posting - Weekend Receptionist\nSunny Hotel needs a weekend receptionist (Sat-Sun, 8 a.m.-4 p.m.). Requirements: friendly manner, basic English. Pay: $14/hour. Email resume to jobs@sunnyhotel.example.com.\n\nApplication Email - From: Ms. Nga\nI am applying for the weekend receptionist job. I speak English well and worked two summers at a resort front desk. My resume is attached. May I visit next Monday for a tour?'),
(889, 7, 'reading', 'How should candidates send their resume?', '["By email to the hotel address", "By fax", "In person", "By post"]', 0, 'Gui email den dia chi khach san. EN: "Email resume to jobs@sunnyhotel.example.com" is instructed.', 'comprehension', 'hr', 824, 'Job Posting - Weekend Receptionist\nSunny Hotel needs a weekend receptionist (Sat-Sun, 8 a.m.-4 p.m.). Requirements: friendly manner, basic English. Pay: $14/hour. Email resume to jobs@sunnyhotel.example.com.\n\nApplication Email - From: Ms. Nga\nI am applying for the weekend receptionist job. I speak English well and worked two summers at a resort front desk. My resume is attached. May I visit next Monday for a tour?'),
