(897, 7, 'reading', 'What is the workshop fee?', '["$80", "$60", "$100", "$120"]', 0, 'Phi $80. EN: "Fee $80" is stated.', 'comprehension', 'sales', 825, 'Notice: Buyers'' Negotiation Workshop, July 22, 1-5 p.m., Room 501. Fee $80. Register by July 15.\n\nRegistration Form - Ms. Linh, ABC Trading. Payment: $80 enclosed. Special request: vegetarian lunch, please.'),
